==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|chn|en}} {{term|potlatch||gift|lang=chn}}, from {{etyl|noo|en}} {{term|p̓ačiƛ||to give in ceremony|lang=noo}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[ceremony]] amongst certain [[Native American]] peoples of the [[Pacific]] [[northwest]] in which [[gift]]s are [[bestow]]ed upon guests and personal property is destroyed in a show of wealth and generosity.
# A communal meal to which guests bring dishes to share.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|communal meal}} [[potluck]] {{qualifier|proscribed}}

